/* ===== Onboarding ===== */
"AI Message Translator" = "AI 消息翻译";
"Type in any language and replace your message with a natural translation — right inside WhatsApp, no copy/paste." = "用任何语言输入，将你的消息替换为自然的翻译——直接在 WhatsApp 中完成，无需复制粘贴。";
"Provider" = "提供商";
"Add your %@ API key to get started." = "添加你的 %@ API 密钥即可开始。";
"Reveal key" = "显示密钥";
"Get a %@ API key" = "获取 %@ API 密钥";
"Stored securely in the iOS Keychain on this device — never in plain settings, and shared only with the keyboard." = "安全存储在本设备的 iOS 钥匙串中——绝不以明文形式保存在设置里，仅与键盘共享。";
"Get Started" = "开始";
"Couldn't save the key" = "无法保存密钥";
"The key couldn't be written to the iOS Keychain. Run the app signed with your Team (from Xcode) or on a device, then try again." = "无法将密钥写入 iOS 钥匙串。请使用你的 Team 签名（通过 Xcode）运行 App 或在真机上运行，然后重试。";

/* ===== Settings ===== */
"API Key" = "API 密钥";
"Configured" = "已配置";
"Not set" = "未设置";
"AI Provider" = "AI 提供商";
"Default is Claude Sonnet for natural, native-sounding translations. Each provider stores its own API key." = "默认使用 Claude Sonnet，提供自然、地道的翻译。每个提供商都保存各自的 API 密钥。";
"Languages" = "语言";
"%lld shown" = "已显示 %lld 个";
"Keyboard" = "键盘";
"Choose which languages appear on the keyboard (up to %lld). The source language is detected automatically." = "选择键盘上显示的语言（最多 %lld 个）。源语言会自动检测。";
"Setup" = "设置步骤";
"About" = "关于";
"Enter your %@ API key above." = "在上方输入你的 %@ API 密钥。";
"Open iOS Settings → General → Keyboard → Keyboards → Add New Keyboard… and add “Keyglot”." = "打开 iOS 设置 → 通用 → 键盘 → 键盘 → 添加新键盘…，然后添加“Keyglot”。";
"Tap “Keyglot” in that list and turn on Allow Full Access (required for network access)." = "在列表中点按“Keyglot”，并打开允许完全访问（联网所需）。";
"In any chat, tap 🌐 to switch to the Keyglot keyboard, then tap a language." = "在任意聊天中点按 🌐 切换到 Keyglot 键盘，然后点按一种语言。";

/* ===== API Key ===== */
"Stored securely in the iOS Keychain on this device. Sent only to %@." = "安全存储在本设备的 iOS 钥匙串中。仅发送给 %@。";
"Save" = "保存";
"Test translation" = "测试翻译";
"Remove key" = "移除密钥";
"“Test” sends one short request to %@ and shows the exact result or error — handy to check the key, model and billing." = "“测试”会向 %@ 发送一次简短请求并显示确切的结果或错误——便于检查密钥、模型和计费。";
"Saved" = "已保存";
"Your %@ API key has been saved." = "你的 %@ API 密钥已保存。";
"Test result" = "测试结果";
"✅ Works.\n\nTranslation:\n%@" = "✅ 正常。\n\n翻译：\n%@";
"❌ Failed.\n\n%@" = "❌ 失败。\n\n%@";

/* ===== About ===== */
"A personal keyboard that translates the message you've already typed — in place, without copy/paste. Write in any language and replace it with a natural, native-sounding translation in the language you pick. The source language is detected automatically." = "一款个人键盘，可就地翻译你已经输入的消息——无需复制粘贴。用任何语言书写，并替换为你所选语言的自然、地道的翻译。源语言会自动检测。";
"How it works" = "工作原理";
"Type your message in any app with your normal keyboard." = "用你平常的键盘在任意 App 中输入消息。";
"Tap 🌐 to switch to the Keyglot keyboard." = "点按 🌐 切换到 Keyglot 键盘。";
"Tap a language — the text is replaced with the translation." = "点按一种语言——文本会被替换为翻译。";
"Press Send." = "点按发送。";
"Choose which languages appear in Settings → Keyboard → Languages." = "在设置 → 键盘 → 语言 中选择要显示的语言。";
"Keyboard languages" = "键盘语言";
"Version" = "版本";
"Model" = "模型";
"Details" = "详情";
"Your API key is stored in the iOS Keychain on this device. Messages are sent only to the selected AI provider for translation." = "你的 API 密钥存储在本设备的 iOS 钥匙串中。消息仅发送给所选的 AI 提供商进行翻译。";
"Developer" = "开发者";
"Developed by Stefania Izzo" = "由 Stefania Izzo 开发";

